<title>USA: Olin to buy DuPont stake in plant.</title>
<headline>Olin to buy DuPont stake in plant.</headline>
<dateline>NORWALK, Conn. 1996-12-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Olin Corp said on Monday that it has reached an agreement in principle to purchase DuPont Co's 50 percent share in the companies' joint venture Niachlor chlor-alkali plant in Niagara Falls, N.Y.</p>
<p>Terms of the proposed transaction, which Olin said it expects to be concluded during the first quarter of 1997, were not disclosed.</p>
<p>Olin said it expects the Niachlor investment to increase earnings in 1997.</p>
<p>The Niachlor membrane cell plant was built by Olin and DuPont in 1987.</p>
</text>
